00:44:39.530 --> 00:44:59.470
<v Dana Chivvis>If they could find someone to compare their adult footprints to their baby footprints, maybe they could put this mystery to bed once and for all. As luck would have it, there was just such a person in Buena Park, California, about 25 miles from Los Angeles where Jason and Randy now live-- a forensic identification specialist by the name of Kurt Kuhn.
<v Dana Chivvis>如果他们能找到人把他们的成人足迹和婴儿足迹进行比较，也许他们就能一劳永逸地解决这个谜团。巧合的是，在加州布埃纳帕克（Buena Park）就有这样一个人，离杰森和兰迪现在住的洛杉矶大约 25 英里——一位名叫库尔特·库恩（Kurt Kuhn）的法医鉴定专家。

00:44:59.470 --> 00:45:12.560
<v Dana Chivvis>But Kurt said there was no way he could use a baby footprint from a hospital. Those aren't made for identification purposes, they're made because baby feet are freaking cute. They're mementos, and they usually don't have much detail.
