<v Dana Chivvis>I wonder if it does. I mean, maybe it only matters if one of you commits murder barefoot, and then runs through wet cement or something.
<v Dana Chivvis>我不知道是否会。我的意思是，也许只有当你们其中一个人光着脚犯了谋杀罪，然后跑过湿水泥之类的东西时才重要。

