<v Jason Sklar>I feel more nervous today than ever before about this. Like, I think when we got into this, I was like, oh, this is going to be so interesting and fascinating. But I really want my mom to be right. Like, I want to be me. I don't know. I just woke up this morning saying, god, I hope my mom was right.
<v Jason Sklar>我今天比以往任何时候都更紧张。我觉得我们刚开始这事时，我心想，噢，这会非常有趣和引人入胜。但我真的希望我妈妈是对的。我想做我自己。我不知道。我今天早上醒来说，天哪，希望我妈妈是对的。

