<v Dana Chivvis>We walk back into the kitchen we left a few hours before. Annette is there with her four grandchildren. Jason and Randy's aunt and uncle are there too and an English bulldog named Roman. We gather around the kitchen island. Jason's five-year-old daughter, Noah, clings to him. Everyone's excited, a little nervous.
<v Dana Chivvis>我们走回几个小时前离开的厨房。安妮特和她的四个孙辈在那里。杰森和兰迪的姨妈和姨夫也在，还有一只叫罗曼的英国斗牛犬。我们聚在厨房岛周围。杰森五岁的女儿诺亚紧紧贴着他。每个人都很兴奋，有点紧张。

00:51:41.760 --> 00:51:44.370
<v Randy Sklar>First of all-- OK, so first of all, how is everyone feeling?
<v Randy Sklar>首先——好的，首先，大家感觉如何？

