00:51:47.070 --> 00:51:53.150
<v Randy Sklar>We got the results, and we found out that I am me and Uncle Jason is Uncle Jason.
<v Randy Sklar>我们拿到了结果，发现我是我，杰森叔叔是杰森叔叔。

00:51:53.150 --> 00:51:57.800
<v Randy Sklar>[CHEERING]
<v Randy Sklar>[欢呼声]

00:51:57.800 --> 00:51:58.260
<v Randy Sklar>[LAUGHTER]
<v Randy Sklar>[笑声]

00:51:58.260 --> 00:52:02.670
<v Annette Sklar>I'm so glad. You actually saw it, for sure.
<v Annette Sklar>我真高兴。你确实看到了，确定了。

00:52:02.670 --> 00:52:03.520
<v Annette Sklar>This is great.
<v Annette Sklar>太棒了。

00:52:03.520 --> 00:52:07.960
<v Annette Sklar>We don't have to think about it. But that's what I thought in my heart. I felt like--
