00:52:21.800 --> 00:52:30.920
<v Randy Sklar>So we went down, and he did our footprint. I know. Look, she's really so happy. She's like legitimately happy. Look at the smile on Mom's face. She's so happy.
<v Randy Sklar>所以我们去了，他做了我们的足迹。我知道。看，她真的太开心了。她真的是心满意足地开心。看妈妈脸上的笑容。她太开心了。

00:52:30.920 --> 00:52:34.700
<v Dana Chivvis>A day later, Randy got Aunt Linda on the phone and told her the good news.
<v Dana Chivvis>一天后，兰迪给琳达阿姨打电话，告诉了她这个好消息。

